<headline>IPO FILING- Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable Corp Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable Corp Ltd</p>
<p>Stock symbol			AWC.N</p>
